       ("Can I book a Delhi–Nainital–Delhi round trip?","Yes. Round trips and tours are billed per kilometre driven (a sedan is ₹12/km, 250 km daily minimum) plus ₹400 a night driver allowance. A 3–4 day trip with Bhimtal, Kainchi Dham and Mukteshwar in the same car is the most popular plan."),
