       ("Kullu–Manali stretch","The highway along the Beas between Kullu and Manali was badly hit by the August 2025 floods. As of April 2026 NHAI repairs were still under way and some sections ran single-lane, so the last 40 km can be slow. The driver checks the day's traffic plan before you leave and uses the left-bank road via Naggar if the main road is held up."),
