       ("Is the Manali to Shimla fare the same?","Yes. The same one-way fares apply from any Manali hotel to anywhere in Shimla, Kufri or Mashobra, and we also run Manali to Shimla drops that continue to Chandigarh or Delhi."),
       ("Can we stop at Kullu or Kasol on the way?","Kullu is on the route, so a stop for shawl shopping or river rafting costs only time. Kasol and Manikaran are a 30 km detour from Bhuntar — add it when you book and we quote one fare."),
